{"product":{"id":10058309304608,"title":"Terreno T30 fine loose Gravel Sport","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe fine loose gravel specialist.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a T-score of 30, the Terreno T30 (formerly the Terreno Dry) is designed for riders who prioritize speed on fine gravel yet demand dependable handling and versatility when conditions become more technical.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Terreno T30 Fine Loose Gravel Sport tire strikes the perfect balance between speed and control on fast-rolling gravel. The T30 features a unique fish scale center strip and is optimized for low rolling resistance while maintaining braking traction and stability in demanding conditions. The siped shoulder knobs are engineered to dig into off-camber sections, offering enhanced grip when cornering, while a gradual ramp-up tread design ensures a smooth, confident transition as you lean into turns.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt with Sport Formulation and Casing, T30 Fine Loose balances speed, grip, and reliability—perfect for recreational riders who want a tire that’s dependable and ready for adventure.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"Gravel Tire","created_at":"2025-09-23T05:30:55-05:00","handle":"terreno-t30-fine-loose-gravel-sport","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:09-05:00","published_at":"2025-10-01T09:22:35-05:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, EP70, Gravel, Gravel Sport, IPP40, Sitewide, Tires","variants":[{"id":50727886881056,"product_id":10058309304608,"title":"700x35c \/ Black","price":"54.99","sku":"11A01104","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"700x35c","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-09-23T05:30:55-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:09-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530039697","grams":720,"image_id":50794286842144,"weight":720.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax